    {"page": 3, "what": "The Graver has no Leader rule printed (only that every warband must have one). William, 6 Nov 2026: \"give 1st guy leader\", so he leads with the usual Leader rule, worded as the other templates' leaders have it."},
    {"page": 1, "what": "No henchmen group size is given for the Thugs (any number may be Thugs): left empty."},
    {"page": 2, "what": "The Hooded Lantern & Rig, Surgeons Journal and Finger Pendant are printed under \"Miscellaneous equipment: Heroes only\" in the henchmen's column: made a third list, which every hero buys from."},
    {"page": 2, "what": "The Pry Bar's and Finger Pendant's boxes give \"Grave Robbers only\" where a rarity goes: read as the warband only, Common. The Hooded Lantern & Rig is Rare 9 at 15+D6 gc and the Surgeons Journal Rare 11 at 80+4D6 gc: the stubs carry those figures."},
    {"page": 2, "what": "The Shovel is listed as a Halberd at 10 gc on both lists: linked to our Halberd, shown as Shovel."},
    {"page": 4, "what": "The special skills are our Grave Robber group's five as they stand (their wording came with our skills table); nothing new is added."}
  ]
